---
source: crates/cli/tests/init.rs
expression: "format!(\"{yaml}---\\n{}\", text(&out.stdout))"
---
# Generated by `sudsy init --from html-validate`; review before use.
extends:
  - preset:html/html-validate-recommended
html:
  lint:
    rules:
      class-pattern: warn
      id-pattern:
        level: error
        options:
          pattern: "^[a-z]+_[a-z]+$"
      no-duplicate-id: error
      no-inline-style: "off"
---
migrated .htmlvalidate.json
extends: preset:html/html-validate-recommended
not migrated: my-shared-config (a shared config or preset is not followed; its rules are not migrated)
not migrated: attr-quotes options (Sudsy's rule has no option for them; set them by hand)
not migrated: class-pattern options (Sudsy's rule has no option for them; set them by hand)
not migrated: close-order (syntax errors are always reported)
not migrated: not-a-rule (not a rule Sudsy knows)
not migrated: valid-autocomplete (needs the autocomplete token grammar (sections, hints, field names by input type))
not migrated: elements (not migrated; set the rules by hand)
